{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位重點提要｜10月30日\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MAG-PROMO-261030.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】政府公布宏福苑火災獨立委員會報告，並提出一系列問責及改革措施。這些措施的力度是否足夠？能否防止類似事件再次發生？</p><p>周五時事全方位，請來嘉賓討論 。</p><p>題目：跟進宏福苑報告</p><p>熱線電話：1833298</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T12:21:54.824937+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T10:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T23:18:45.855729+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T12:18:24.147859+00:00","content_hash":"22cc0abde1ea4eb54dd8d6291776d7ba35a8a4ee7a79ab2f854565b8418d8de5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}